SUMMARY:[Senior Friday] Tech Help Drop-In
DESCRIPTION:Please note: This session will be held in the Auditorium during 
 Senior Friday's lunch hour.\n\n\nBring your personal device to the library 
 to receive one-on-one assistance with everyday technology issues. We can 
 answer your questions\, help resolve a tech challenge\, and connect you 
 with more resources and programs at the library and beyond.\n\nThis hour is 
 drop-in and first come\, first served. This hour is best suited for quick 
 tech questions.\n\n \n
