X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup Metrotrails": "https://www.meetup.com/metrotrails/events/314952127/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_metrotrails
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Metrotrails Hiking
UID:event_314952127@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260606T040949Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260607T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260607T180000
SUMMARY:NY Ridge\, Valley\, Lake and Rail Hike
DESCRIPTION:Metrotrails: NJ\, PA\, NY Metropolitan Area Hiking and More!\n
 Join us for this very diverse hike featuring totally different types of ar
 eas in the Orange County NY area!\nThis time\, we will meet at our end poi
 nt\, Fancher Davidge Park\, and shuttle with as few vehicles as possible t
 o the beginning. There is extremely limited parking area the beginning\, s
 o everyone should try to be at the posted meet point.\nThe hike will start
  with a lovely walk on the Shawangunk Ridge Trail\, which is entirely on t
 he old Erie Railroad main line at this point for almost five miles.\nThe l
 ine ascends the flank of Shawangunk Ridge\, and so the rail bed affords so
 me views along the way.\nWe will walk into Otisville\, where we can stop a
 t Mick's Deli.\nWe continue through a couple of cemeteries\, past two scho
 ols and through Mt Hope Town Park and pass another cafe.\nNext\, we have 2
 .5 mils on road we must do to reach the Middletown Reservoir trail system.
  From here\, we have over five more miles of hiking off road we will do ac
 ross the preserve to reach Middletown A short road walk and rail bed leads
  us to the end.\nDistance will be 15 miles. If needed\, contact me at 908 
 343 8374
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/metrotrails/events/314952127/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260525T185438Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260525T185438Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
