X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Gcal Id8Bbkkkfmscdavi2Jilkb2Muo": "https://fccmontclair.org/upcoming-events-at-fcc/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:gcal_id8bbkkkfmscdavi2jilkb2muo
URL:https://fccmontclair.org/upcoming-events-at-fcc/
SUMMARY:Congregational Meeting\, Immediately After Worship (...or Zoom lin
 k below)
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260607T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260607T123000
DTSTAMP:20260606T040946Z
UID:3fksqj0rekf2gm7sdcavletccq@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20260607T120000
SEQUENCE:0
CREATED:20260520T143926Z
DESCRIPTION:<p><b><i><span> </span>If you're not able to attend you can u
 se this Zoom link</i>:</b>  <a href="https://us06web.zoom.us/j/895544721
 08">https://us06web.zoom.us/j/89554472108</a></p><p><span> As a congregat
 ional church we are responsible for charting our own future. And we are ca
 lled upon to cast our vote when important decisions need to be made. On Su
 nday\, June 7th\, immediately following worship\, we will gather for a bri
 ef meeting to share updates and make decisions important to our Church fam
 ily. </span></p><p><span>Please join us for a vote on our budget and upco
 ming slate of officers as well as information on our finances\, MMO (FCC's
  preschool)\, and our plans to move forward in growth and progress.  We l
 ook forward to sharing and discussing all of this with you!<br> <br>At a 
 Congregational Meeting\, only church members may vote\, but we welcome ALL
  interested friends of the church to attend. Looking forward to seeing you
  there!</span></p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260605T201537Z
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-SOURCE:First Congregational Church Montclair
END:VEVENT
