SUMMARY:Outpost in the Burbs - Shannon McNally
DESCRIPTION:Presented by Outpost in the Burbs.\n\nShannon McNally performs on Sunday\, June 7th\, 4:00PM on the wisteria terrace behind Van Vleck House. Seating is on your own blanket or lawn chair on the formal garden lawn* facing Van Vleck House.\n\nThe gardens will close to visitors at 3:00 PM. Only ticket holders will be permitted to remain. The gates will open at 3:30 PM for ticket holders.\n\nTickets are required. Family pack tickets are available.\nhttps://outpostintheburbs.thundertix.com/events/259784\n\n\n*No pets\, alcohol\, glass or tents permitted.
