SUMMARY:The Uptown Boogie Band live at Montclair Brewery
DESCRIPTION:Together for over 11 years\, and with a combined 100+ years of playing experience\, The Uptown Boogie Band has the experience and knowledge of putting on a great show with popular music from the 40’s to the present! Popular blues\, swing\, and classic rock are just a few genres this band covers. \n$5 cover charge per person that goes directly to the artists. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
