SUMMARY:Soy Candlemaking 101: Vintage Tea Cup Candles
DESCRIPTION:This is a paid Adult School class. Click here to 
 register.\nVintage tea cups are great for more than sipping tea.  In this 
 class you will learn how to turn extra china around your home into 
 beautiful eco-friendly candles.  Each student will learn the art of 
 melting\, scenting and pouring soy candles and will leave with 2 tea cup 
 candles. All materials will be provided.
LOCATION:Montclair Main - Cafe Area\, Montclair Public Library
