SUMMARY:C3Worx presents: Smarter Ways to Use Microsoft Copilot in 2026
DESCRIPTION:Stop experimenting with AI—and start using it where it actually impacts your business. \nIn this NJBIA Business Growth Roundtable\, co-hosted with the NJ AI Hub\, we’ll walk through real\, practical Copilot use cases across sales\, operations\, and leadership so you can immediately improve how your team works. \nYou’ll see—and practice—how to:\n• Turn meetings into clear action plans and follow-ups in minutes\n• Draft client emails\, proposals\, and internal updates 2–3x faster\n• Extract insights from notes\, documents\, and conversations to move deals forward\n• Use workflows and automation to reduce administrative drag so your team can focus on revenue-generating work \nYou’ll leave with:\n• Repeatable prompts and workflows you can use immediately\n• Real examples tied to business outcomes (not theory)\n• A clearer understanding of where Copilot actually drives ROI—and where it doesn’t \nThis session is perfect for:\n• Business owners and executives\n• Sales\, marketing\, operations\, and finance leaders\n• Department heads evaluating AI adoption\n• Organizations exploring or actively deploying AI solutions \nWhether you’re shaping your AI strategy or looking to scale your current initiatives\, this session will provide practical insight to help you turn AI interest into real business impact. \nRegister today.\nhttps://us02web.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_t6d9aGQUQsm0h0ONh_h7Ug \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/c3worx-presents-smarter-ways-to-use-microsoft-copilot-in-2026/
LOCATION:NJ
CATEGORIES:Community,General Events,Virtual Event
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://montclairlocal.news/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/June-BGRT_1200x800-2.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="C3Workplace":MAILTO:derya@c3workplace.com
END:VEVENT
