SUMMARY:The Sheep Detectives
DTSTART:20260611T134500
DTEND:20260611T154500
UID:1d6f615d457c8c37d211c48f1bc97bb1@montclairfilm.org
DESCRIPTION:A shepherd reads detective novels to his beloved sheep every n
 ight\, assuming they can’t possibly understand. But when a mysterious in
