SUMMARY:[MILL Senior Friday] Ask the Doctor: Dr. Max Willinger
DESCRIPTION:Join us on Fridays for a day full of events for Seniors with 
 the MILL @ MPL! All events are free and open to the public. Registration is 
 recommended unless otherwise noted.\n\n\nDr. Max Willinger will be 
 discussing knee and hip surgery options and answering audience 
 questions.\n\nHOW TO REGISTER\nThis class is run by the MILL. Please 
 register for classes directly through their website here.\n\nFor questions 
 about MILL classes please call 973-744-3278.\n\nMILL @ MPL is made possible 
 through a partnership between the MILL\, Montclair Public Library and 
 Partners for Health.
