UID:10007507-1781352000-1781357400@montclairfoundation.org
SUMMARY:Fathers Day Secret Tea at Van Vleck - SOLD OUT!
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a special Early Father’s Day Celebration! \n\n\nDo you have a father or a father figure you cherish? Or a child who holds a special place in your heart? If so\, this tea is for you! Please note children must be 8+. \nThis event will include fine teas\, savory sandwiches\, freshly baked scones\, and three desserts. Please see the information tab at the top of the page for information about dietary restrictions\, cancellation policy\, and what to expect. \n$60 Members | $70 General Public\nA 10% gratuity for your server is included in tea pricing. \nThis event is for adults and children ages 8+. Seatings are 90 minutes\, and registration is required. \nDietary Restrictions\nA gluten-free option is available with prior notice. We are not able to accommodate a dairy-free or vegan diet. All requests must be communicated to us 48 hours before the event. You may note this request on the checkout page. For dietary/allergy inquiries\, please contact richard@secrettearoom.us. \nCancellation Policy\nWe are unable to accommodate cancellations or rescheduling. If you find you are no longer able to attend your scheduled event\, you may transfer your ticket(s) to another person(s) to attend instead. Please notify Van Vleck House and Gardens so we can update your ticket name(s) for event check-in. \nPlease note that this event is a fundraiser\, and a portion of your ticket price will go towards supporting our beloved Van Vleck House & Gardens.
URL:https://montclairfoundation.org/event/fathers-day-secret-tea-at-van-vleck/
CATEGORIES:Events,Adults,Family
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://montclairfoundation.org/content/uploads/2025/02/Tea-Room-icons_pot-1.png
END:VEVENT
