X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_metrotrails
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Metrotrails Hiking
UID:event_315125021@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260606T040949Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260614T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260614T183000
SUMMARY:Chester County Abandoned Rail Trace Hike
DESCRIPTION:Metrotrails: NJ\, PA\, NY Metropolitan Area Hiking and More!\n
 Join us for this interesting point to point hike tracing as close as we ca
 n to some of the more obscure abandoned railroad beds in Chester County PA
 !\nMeet at the Uwchlan Trailhead on Dowlin Forge Road where it hits the St
 ruble Trail. From here\, we will shuttle with as few cars as possible nort
 h to the area fo Struble Lake.\nWe'll follow some pleasant back roads for 
 a bit\, first tracing some of the former Wilmington and Northern line.\nFr
 om here\, we'll head to the junction site at Supplee.\nWe'll continue down
  along a branch of the Brandywine Creek using various trails and parks\, s
 ometimes directly on the former New Holland Branch of the Pennsylvania Rai
 lroad\, sometimes close to it on back roads.\nWe'll pass a great many form
 er station sites.\nThere are quite a few little parks we'll pass through\,
  and the back roads will be pretty nice as well.\nIf needed\, contact me a
 t 908 343 8374
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/metrotrails/events/315125021/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260605T223404Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260605T223404Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
