BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Gcal Uumontclair Org 9Kptanknnvqcom49Ks44Nnaaak": "https://www.uumontclair.org/events"}
X-SOURCE-ID:gcal_uumontclair_org_9kptanknnvqcom49ks44nnaaak
URL:https://www.uumontclair.org/events
SUMMARY:Connection Cafe- And Send off Celebration
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260614T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260614T122000
DTSTAMP:20260606T041003Z
UID:o874lo1q9ekcedna70imb0c8rk_R20230319T150000@google.com__20260614
SEQUENCE:1
CREATED:20220609T153046Z
DESCRIPTION:<u></u><u></u>You are invited to join us for our in person Con
 nection Café every Sunday at 11:00 AM. Coffee will be provided. If you ha
 ven’t yet experienced our online Connection Café\, give it a try. Parti
 cipants report that this format allows us to build relationships across th
 e congregation in ways that will sustain us as individual participants and
  support our growth as a community. So grab your coffee and join us for a 
 fun way to connect on Sunday morning. All are welcome. We hope you can joi
 n us! <br><br>Set up for Carltons - What we would like is the maximum num
 ber of hightop tables because we’re going to have note cards and pens av
 ailable for people to write messages to the Carltons and that is the best 
 height. <div dir="auto"><div dir="auto">We decided that one large round t
 able set center for those people who are not able to stand should be suffi
 cient. <div dir="auto"><div dir="auto">We will have a large cake and two 
 fruit bowls and so if we could have one or two long tables set up that wou
 ld be great as we don’t want to put any food on any of the other tables.
 <div dir="auto"><div dir="auto">In addition to email my cell is 973 600-3
 267 and if you can confirm that this plan is OK that would be great. <br>
 <br><u></u><u></u>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260604T121859Z
LOCATION:UUCM-1-Fletcher Hall (306)
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-SOURCE:UU Congregation of Montclair
END:VEVENT
