SUMMARY:Second Sunday Concert: Gerard & Diane Barros
DESCRIPTION:June 14\, 2:00 PM Country & Western Hoedown on the terrace \nGerard & Diane Barros are a unique husband and wife / keyboard and guitar duo\, specializing in 2- part harmonies\, playing tunes. from the 1940s to 2000s. With an “old school duo” approach to playing instruments and singing\, this versatile pair of musicians provides great entertainment with an eclectic/retro setlist that consists of more than 60 years’ worth of some of the best popular music. \nPlease bring a blanket or lawn chairs for this outdoor concert behind Van Vleck House. The event is weather-dependent so please check our website and your email if the forecast is uncertain. \n \nReservations are recommended. Walk-ins without reservations will be seated on a space-available basis. \nThis concert is free but a donation of $10 at the door is greatly appreciated to support the series. \nThanks to our series patrons for their support this season.
URL:https://montclairfoundation.org/event/second-sunday-concert-gerard-diane-barros/
LOCATION:Van Vleck House & Gardens\, 21 Van Vleck Street\, Montclair\, 07042\, United States
CATEGORIES:Events,Adults
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://montclairfoundation.org/content/uploads/2025/10/GD-Country-Pic2.jpg
END:VEVENT
