SUMMARY:Tech Help Desk
DESCRIPTION:Please note: This session will be held in the Group Study Area 
 on the second floor.\n\n\nBring your personal device to the library to 
 receive one-on-one assistance with everyday technology issues. We can 
 answer your questions\, help resolve a tech challenge\, and connect you 
 with more resources and programs at the library and beyond.\n\nThis hour is 
 drop-in and first come\, first served. This hour is best suited for quick 
 tech questions.
