SUMMARY:Tales on the Trails - Magic of Moths
DESCRIPTION:Tales on the Trails \nWednesdays\, 1:00 PM -1:45 PM \nAge: Preschool 3-5 year olds \nJune 17th – Magic of Moths \nWhat’s flying around the gardens? Is it a butterfly or could it be a moth? Learn about moths at this month’s Tales on the Trails.  \nDiscover the wonders of the outdoor world with your little one.  This program begins in the gardens of Van Vleck with a story\, then continues with a walk and concludes with a simple craft or activity.  All programs focus on the theme listed.  A parent or caregiver must accompany each child.  Programs will be held outdoors\, weather permitting. \nFee: $10/class per child for Members / $15/class per child for General Public \nRegistration required by 1 day prior to each class
URL:https://montclairfoundation.org/event/tales-on-the-trails-magic-of-moths/
LOCATION:Van Vleck House & Gardens\, 21 Van Vleck Street\, Montclair\, 07042\, United States
CATEGORIES:Classes,Children
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://montclairfoundation.org/content/uploads/2025/12/image-31.png
END:VEVENT
